│                       Phase 1: FIX ANALYSIS                        │
│                                                                    │
│  1 Problem summary                                                 │
│                                                                    │
│ The bug is that instruction cache usage is not suppressed while    │
│ the core is in debug mode.                                         │
│ In debug mode, instruction fetches must bypass caching behavior to │
│ avoid stale/incorrect instruction execution (as documented in      │
│ upstream Ibex issue/commit).                                       │
│                                                                    │
│  2 Where it occurs                                                 │
│                                                                    │
│ From the provided context, the key point is in rtl/ibex_core.sv at │
│ IF-stage instantiation:                                            │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│  .icache_enable_i       (icache_enable),                           │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│ debug_mode is already available in ibex_core and passed to IF      │
│ stage, but it is not used to gate cache enable here. So the IF     │
│ stage (and underlying icache path) can still cache instructions    │
│ during debug mode.                                                 │
│                                                                    │
│  3 Best practices for the fix                                      │
│                                                                    │
│  • Keep fix minimal and localized.                                 │
│  • Reuse existing debug_mode signal (already generated and wired). │
│  • Avoid changing interfaces unless necessary.                     │
│  • Preserve normal cache behavior outside debug mode.              │
│  • Make behavior explicit and easy to audit.                       │
│                                                                    │
│  4 Fix approach                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│ Gate the IF-stage cache-enable input with ~debug_mode:             │
│                                                                    │
│  • When debug_mode == 1, IF-stage sees cache disabled.             │
│  • When debug_mode == 0, behavior is unchanged.                    │
│                                                                    │
│ This mirrors upstream intent and avoids broader structural         │
│ changes.                                                           │
