│                                                                    │
│  1 Problem summary                                                 │
│                                                                    │
│ The core currently allows instruction cache use while in debug     │
│ mode.                                                              │
│ That can return stale/cached instructions instead of fetching      │
│ directly from memory, which breaks debugger expectations (e.g.,    │
│ when code is patched in memory while halted).                      │
│                                                                    │
│  2 Where it occurs                                                 │
