│ selection (PLRU path), while prefetch-hit path does not.           │
│                                                                    │
│  3 Best practices for fix                                          │
│                                                                    │
│  • Keep behavior consistent for the same op type (CMO_PREFETCH)    │
│    across hit/miss.                                                │
│  • Make minimal, localized RTL changes.                            │
│  • Avoid changing protocol/state-machine structure when only       │
│    policy gating is needed.                                        │
│  • Preserve existing behavior for non-prefetch read misses.        │
│                                                                    │
