│                       Phase 1: FIX ANALYSIS                        │
│                                                                    │
│  1 Problem summary                                                 │
│                                                                    │
│ The issue reports inconsistent PLRU behavior for CMO_PREFETCH when │
│ prefetch_updt_plru == 1:                                           │
│                                                                    │
│  • On prefetch hit: PLRU is not updated.                           │
│  • On prefetch miss: PLRU is updated on refill response.           │
│                                                                    │
│ That inconsistency is real: miss path already has explicit gating  │
│ with cfg_prefetch_updt_sel_victim_i in hpdcache_miss_handler.sv,   │
│ while hit path in controller does not use the equivalent config    │
│ gating for prefetch-hit PLRU update.                               │
│                                                                    │
│  2 Where it occurs                                                 │
│                                                                    │
│  • Miss path already supports configurable update:                 │
│     • rtl/src/hpdcache_miss_handler.sv uses:                       │
│        • cfg_prefetch_updt_sel_victim_i                            │
│        • refill_updt_sel_victim_o = ~refill_is_error_o &           │
│          (~is_prefetch | cfg_prefetch_updt_sel_victim_i);          │
│  • Hit path PLRU update goes through controller -> memctrl via:    │
│     • rtl/src/hpdcache_ctrl.sv port                                │
│       .dir_updt_sel_victim_i(st1_req_updt_sel_victim)              │
│     • This does not include prefetch-hit + config-based update     │
│       path.                                                        │
│                                                                    │
│  3 Best practices for the fix                                      │
│                                                                    │
│  • Keep behavior unchanged for non-prefetch operations.            │
│  • Reuse existing config semantics                                 │
│    (cfg_prefetch_updt_sel_victim_i) for symmetry between hit and   │
│    miss paths.                                                     │
│  • Make minimal RTL changes; avoid altering protocol FSMs unless   │
