│     • The issue description points out that in the flow where a0   │
│       is restored from dscratch1 before entering the abstract      │
│       command, a0 and dscratch1 may already hold the same value.   │
│     • Therefore, generating an extra CSR move for a0 may be        │
│       redundant in the abstract command sequence.                  │
