│ IdleCSBActive state handling:                                      │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│  if (command_i.csid != csid_q) begin                               │
│    prestall_st_d = WaitTrail;                                      │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│ The bug is not in the IdleCSBActive branch itself, but in the      │
│ transition behavior after WaitTrail. In the relevant flow, the FSM │
│ should eventually transition into CSBSwitch when a CSID change has │
│ occurred, but the incorrect path currently causes it to go through │
│ WaitIdle instead.                                                  │
