│ logic is in the WaitTrail state:                                   │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│  if (trail_cntr_q == 4'h0) begin                                   │
│    prestall_st_d = WaitIdle;                                       │
│  end                                                               │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│ This transition should preserve CSID-switch semantics and go to    │
│ CSBSwitch when a new CSID needs to be handled.                     │
